{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to battle for the title of top eatery? Yes, Chef!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just inherited your grandma\u2019s once-famous meatball restaurant in the cozy town of KuloNiku. Now it\u2019s up to you to bring it back to glory as the top eatery! Take on eccentric orders from townsfolk, serve delicious meals, and restore your family\u2019s legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware\u2014there\u2019s fierce competition from the town\u2019s flashiest rival: Souper Starz, run by the menacing rockstar chef, Stella!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/5faf6e840f5ee24624583590ed31a00b.avif?t=1773743461\" width=750 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/0e826b0b7b841e5411279b305c802719.poster.avif?t=1773743461\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/0e826b0b7b841e5411279b305c802719.webm?t=1773743461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/0e826b0b7b841e5411279b305c802719.mp4?t=1773743461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chop, boil, fry, torch, pour, sizzle, slice, </strong>and<strong> skewer</strong>, and more with immersive, tactile controls that make every action tickle your brain and make your mouth water.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to add an extra punch of garlic or a sprinkle of salt? Go for it. You\u2019re the chef \u2013 <strong>find multiple ways</strong> to prepare your customers the perfect dish and rack up those <strong>juicy tips</strong>! \ud83d\udcb0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your customers aren\u2019t just customers. Some may become your <strong>friends</strong>\u00a0\ud83e\udd1d, <strong>rivals</strong> \u2694\ufe0f, or even part of your story \ud83d\udcd6.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/7786b4e8e2d0200b949c804b04bbab9f.avif?t=1773743461\" width=750 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/ed925969b34b4074efe844e502c3ff7b.poster.avif?t=1773743461\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/ed925969b34b4074efe844e502c3ff7b.webm?t=1773743461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/ed925969b34b4074efe844e502c3ff7b.mp4?t=1773743461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rival chefs want the top spot, and there\u2019s only one way to settle things: Meatball Brawls!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these thrilling culinary duels, you\u2019ll go head-to-head to impress a panel of rotating judges. It\u2019s not just about speed - it\u2019s about strategy, creativity, and mastering every step of the cooking process.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play mini-games to impress both the judges and the crowd watching live, who will issue on-the-spot requests to boost your score!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/3d6cc32101fe5098f6b5e260815cf422.avif?t=1773743461\" width=750 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/6180d4e07abe068927961f008115e8d5.poster.avif?t=1773743461\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/6180d4e07abe068927961f008115e8d5.webm?t=1773743461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/6180d4e07abe068927961f008115e8d5.mp4?t=1773743461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep things fresh! Unlock new tools, purchase higher-quality ingredients, and discover brand-new recipes to keep your menu exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your restaurant with fun decorations in a variety of styles - even buy full sets! Decor isn\u2019t just cosmetic; some items give gameplay perks to impress your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock special decorations by playing in special festivals or raising your friendship level with town residents!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/42d50ee549628d471b2a85c58522af5a.avif?t=1773743461\" width=750 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/f229c683f1e5c71f8900212d536e38d8.poster.avif?t=1773743461\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/f229c683f1e5c71f8900212d536e38d8.webm?t=1773743461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/f229c683f1e5c71f8900212d536e38d8.mp4?t=1773743461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An eclectic cast of characters awaits you in KuloNiku - No matter friend or rival (or both??), they've all got  stories to tell!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your friendship level with a cast of companions to unlock special illustrations and decorations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of your eye-raising past and save your grandmother's restaurant alongside your friends!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3357960?t=1773743461","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/180a44930435aa6b5a2b901d903c91121500bcfd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773743461","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/f8569307d7023b41f155ed3f34c8fdec7a320ed1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773743461","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/f8569307d7023b41f155ed3f34c8fdec7a320ed1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773743461","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3732560,"description":""}],"detailed_description