fry, torch, pour, sizzle, slice, </strong>and<strong> skewer</strong>, and more with immersive, tactile controls that make every action tickle your brain and make your mouth water.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to add an extra punch of garlic or a sprinkle of salt? Go for it. You\u2019re the chef \u2013 <strong>find multiple ways</strong> to prepare your customers the perfect dish and rack up those <strong>juicy tips</strong>! \ud83d\udcb0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your customers aren\u2019t just customers. Some may become your <strong>friends</strong>\u00a0\ud83e\udd1d, <strong>rivals</strong> \u2694\ufe0f, or even part of your story \ud83d\udcd6.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/7786b4e8e2d0200b949c804b04bbab9f.avif?t=1773743461\" width=750 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/ed925969b34b4074efe844e502c3ff7b.poster.avif?t=1773743461\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/ed925969b34b4074efe844e502c3ff7b.webm?t=1773743461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/ed925969b34b4074efe844e502c3ff7b.mp4?t=1773743461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rival chefs want the top spot, and there\u2019s only one way to settle things: Meatball Brawls!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these thrilling culinary duels, you\u2019ll go head-to-head to impress a panel of rotating judges. It\u2019s not just about speed - it\u2019s about strategy, creativity, and mastering every step of the cooking process.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play mini-games to impress both the judges and the crowd watching live, who will issue on-the-spot requests to boost your score!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/3d6cc32101fe5098f6b5e260815cf422.avif?t=1773743461\" width=750 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/6180d4e07abe068927961f008115e8d5.poster.avif?t=1773743461\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/6180d4e07abe068927961f008115e8d5.webm?t=1773743461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/6180d4e07abe068927961f008115e8d5.mp4?t=1773743461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep things fresh! Unlock new tools, purchase higher-quality ingredients, and discover brand-new recipes to keep your menu exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your restaurant with fun decorations in a variety of styles - even buy full sets! Decor isn\u2019t just cosmetic; some items give gameplay perks to impress your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock special decorations by playing in special festivals or raising your friendship level with town residents!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/42d50ee549628d471b2a85c58522af5a.avif?t=1773743461\" width=750 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/f229c683f1e5c71f8900212d536e38d8.poster.avif?t=1773743461\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/f229c683f1e5c71f8900212d536e38d8.webm?t=1773743461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/f229c683f1e5c71f8900212d536e38d8.mp4?t=1773743461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An eclectic cast of characters awaits you in KuloNiku - No matter friend or rival (or both??), they've all got  stories to tell!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your friendship level with a cast of companions to unlock special illustrations and decorations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of your eye-raising past and save your grandmother's restaurant alongside your friends!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Gambir Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/f26df061f756e1810fae07c436df384305107d11/header.jpg?t=1773743461","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Copyright 2026 Gambir Studio. Developed by Gambir Studio. Published by Raw Fury AB. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><stron